        "original_id": "389f4188-a0d0-52d1-865f-df8c771c214e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Karaar, Galgale Nighale\n- People: Manoj Kotian, Subodh Bhave, Urmila Kothare, Kranti Redkar, Suhasini Mule, Aarti More, Avdhoot Gupte, Shreya Ghoshal, Bela Shende, Sonu Kakkar, Jasraj Joshi, Neha Rajpal, Vaishali Samant, Anand Shinde\n- Roles: director, actor, singer, music composer, lyricist, playback singer\n- Topics: Marathi film and music industry\n\nFacts:\n- Karaar is a Marathi feature film directed by Manoj Kotian.\n- Karaar stars Subodh Bhave, Urmila Kothare, Kranti Redkar, Suhasini Mule, and Aarti More.\n- Songs from Karaar are sung by Avdhoot Gupte, Shreya Ghoshal, Bela Shende, Sonu Kakkar, Jasraj Joshi, Neha Rajpal, and Vaishali Samant.\n- Vaishali Samant is an Indian music composer, lyricist, and playback singer known for her work in the Marathi film and music industry.\n- Gori Gauri Mandavakhali is a superhit song from Galgale Nighale sung by Vaishali Samant and Anand Shinde.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
